F src/cli/neighbours.test.ts e024db3f17e9 2026-10-10 80552949+warrendeanlangeveldt/human Tests for ctx neighbours (VIEW-2) in a throwaway repository: a file's imports and importers marked current, stale or missing from their cards' hashes, the noimport rule a file breaks (src must not import lib), and a file with no imports and one importer.
